Bigscreen Beyond eye-tracking bridge for Linux

This standalone distribution was extracted from tools/beyond-gaze in the
Baballonia workspace. The native bridge source is unchanged. README.md was
adapted for standalone setup, and CMakeLists.txt was updated to include this
notice and the project license in the installed driver distribution.

The Babble Software Distribution License 1.0 and its copyright notice are
retained in LICENSE. OpenVR SDK headers and the upstream driver reference
retain their respective license and provenance files under vendor/.
